; addquad_index_out_of_range: ADDQUAD carries the same bound as SETQUAD.
;
; Separate from setquad_index_out_of_range because the two reach the model
; through different methods -- add_quad accumulates onto whatever is already
; there -- and the missing check was duplicated rather than shared.
;
; j is exactly at the extent, the off-by-one, where the SETQUAD vector uses a
; value well past it.

PUSH 4
BQMX r0

PUSH 1           ; i, in range
PUSH 4           ; j == size
PUSH 7           ; delta
ADDQUAD r0
HALT
